#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:1
msgid ""
"**Warning**   \n"
"This program is [**experimental**](../../development/experimental-"
"features.md#xp-feature-nix-command) and its interface is subject to change."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:8
msgid ""
"`nix store cat` - print the contents of a file in the Nix store on stdout"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "概要"

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:12
msgid "`nix store cat` \\[_option_...\\] _path_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:16
msgid "Show the contents of a file in a binary cache:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:18
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix store cat --store https://cache.nixos.org/ \\\n"
"    /nix/store/qbhyj3blxpw2i6pb7c6grc9185nbnpvy-hello-2.10/bin/hello | "
"hexdump -C | head -n1\n"
"00000000  7f 45 4c 46 02 01 01 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  "
"|.ELF............|\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:24
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-cat.md:26
msgid ""
"This command prints on standard output the contents of the regular file "
"_path_ in a Nix store. _path_ can be a top-level store path or any file "
"inside a store path."
msgstr ""

